WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Tlosa jwang le mefoka sedikadikweng seo sefate se tla mela ho sona.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Tjheka sekoti se sephara ho feta bolo ya metso, ka botebo ba yona. Beha mobu o ka hodimo ka thoko.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Tlatsa sekoti ka metsi. Ha metsi a ntse a eme letsatsing le hlahlamang, lema hodima qubu e phahamisitsweng.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:33.000
Bapisa bokahodimo ba bolo ya metso le mobu. Sebaka se hlomathisitsweng se be hodimo ho mobu.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Hatella mobu ka bonolo. Etsa sekotlolo sa metsi mme o boloke mulch hole le kutu.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:51.000
Nosetsa haholo hore metsi a fihle metsong ya sefate se setjha.
